<div class="columnArticleClass two-layout-bg-white" id="oneColumnArticleTheme"><div id="sectionHeadingForOneColumnArticle"><div class="section-heading mb-4 container text-start" data-ste-element="Sites: Section Heading"><div><div class="row text-start"><div class="col col-md-8"><h2 class="header-focus"><span>Why SIPROTEC 7SD82?</span></h2></div></div></div></div></div><div class="text-start container multitextblock "><div class="row justify-content-left"><div class="col col-md-8"><p>SIPROTEC 7SD82 provides line differential protection for medium and high-voltage systems. It offers cost-optimized, compact protection for your electrical lines to deliver safety and reliability across all voltage levels for overhead lines and cables.</p><p>Electrical systems face faults like transformer errors, current-transformer saturation and capacitive charging currents. SIPROTEC 7SD82 includes an adaptive differential protection algorithm to enable system stability. Maintain operational continuity, avoid costly downtime and detect ground faults in diverse power systems.</p><p>Optimize space with the compact, low-cost design of the SIPROTEC 7SD82. Conformal coating on electronic boards helps the SIPROTEC 7SD82 perform in harsh conditions.</p></div></div></div></div></div><div id='2WmbW76xLH8r2ZbaRCNju3' class='sitesThreeColTiles themed-component-wrapper' data-ste-section='three-col-tiles_2' data-ste-section-id='2WmbW76xLH8r2ZbaRCNju3'>
