<div><div class="section-heading mb-4 container text-start" data-ste-element="Sites: Section Heading"><div><div class="row text-start"><div class="col col-md-8"><h2 class="header-focus"><span>Key benefits</span></h2></div></div></div></div><div class="container three-column-tile"><div class="row"><div data-ste-element="teaser" data-ste-teaser-type="tile" data-ste-teaser-title="Reduce costs" class="col-12 col-sm-12 col-md-6 col-lg-4 tileHeightAdjust"><div class="tile-flex-wrapper"><h3 class="strong tileHeading">Reduce costs</h3><div class="tileDescription"><p>Lower operating costs over the lifecycle of your plant with compact and efficient differential protection for your systems. Future-proof your operations with a system that will require less maintenance long-term.</p></div></div></div><div data-ste-element="teaser" data-ste-teaser-type="tile" data-ste-teaser-title="Improve safety" class="col-12 col-sm-12 col-md-6 col-lg-4 tileHeightAdjust"><div class="tile-flex-wrapper"><h3 class="strong tileHeading">Improve safety</h3><div class="tileDescription"><p>Prioritize safety with powerful protection functions that increase the quality of your engineering processes. Make fast, effective and proactive decisions with clear data.</p></div></div></div><div data-ste-element="teaser" data-ste-teaser-type="tile" data-ste-teaser-title="Access data easily" class="col-12 col-sm-12 col-md-6 col-lg-4 tileHeightAdjust"><div class="tile-flex-wrapper"><h3 class="strong tileHeading">Access data easily</h3><div class="tileDescription"><p>Secure data and maintain transparency across the plant lifecycle to save time and resources. Access device data simply and securely via a web browser.</p></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div id='7DUkAcHGsQFs2A4etOjFWW' class='sitesCardsContainer themed-component-wrapper' data-ste-section='cards-container_3' data-ste-section-id='7DUkAcHGsQFs2A4etOjFWW'><is-land on:visible><div id="comp-7DUkAcHGsQFs2A4etOjFWW" class="CardsContainer" data-component-type="CardsContainer"><section id="7DUkAcHGsQFs2A4etOjFWW" class="cards-defaultBackground" role="region" aria-labelledby="section-heading-7DUkAcHGsQFs2A4etOjFWW"><div class="section-heading mb-4 container text-start" data-ste-element="Sites: Section Heading"><div><div class="row text-start"><div class="col col-md-8"><h2 class="header-focus"><span>Featured capabilities</span></h2></div></div></div></div><div class="container"><div class="row cards-container-row"><div class="siemens-cards col-md-4"><div data-ste-element="teaser" data-ste-teaser-type="card" data-ste-teaser-title="Differential protection for MV and HV" id="G_Differential%20protection%20for%20MV%20and%20HV-0" class="card blogWrapNoLink rounded-0" role="article" aria-labelledby="G_Differential%20protection%20for%20MV%20and%20HV-0-title" aria-describedby="G_Differential%20protection%20for%20MV%20and%20HV-0-desc" tabindex="0"><div class="imageWrapper"></div><div class="card-body d-flex flex-column p-3"><strong class="text-kicker pb-2 mb-0 text-color"></strong><div class="category d-none">all</div><h3 id="G_Differential%20protection%20for%20MV%20and%20HV-0-title" class="pb-4 mb-0">Differential protection for MV and HV</h3><div id="G_Differential%20protection%20for%20MV%20and%20HV-0-desc" class="text-black card-text pb-3 mb-0"><div><p>Implement differential protection for medium and high-voltage applications. Achieve interoperability between SIPROTEC 5 and 4 devices for comprehensive line protection. Respond rapidly with a 19 ms minimum tripping time.</p></div></div><div data-area="card-info-section" class="d-flex flex-column justify-content-end h-100"></div></div></div></div><div class="siemens-cards col-md-4"><div data-ste-element="teaser" data-ste-teaser-type="card" data-ste-teaser-title="Advanced configuration functions" id="G_Advanced%20configuration%20functions-1" class="card blogWrapNoLink rounded-0" role="article" aria-labelledby="G_Advanced%20configuration%20functions-1-title" aria-describedby="G_Advanced%20configuration%20functions-1-desc" tabindex="0"><div class="imageWrapper"></div><div class="card-body d-flex flex-column p-3"><strong class="text-kicker pb-2 mb-0 text-color"></strong><div class="category d-none">all</div><h3 id="G_Advanced%20configuration%20functions-1-title" class="pb-4 mb-0">Advanced configuration functions</h3><div id="G_Advanced%20configuration%20functions-1-desc" class="text-black card-text pb-3 mb-0"><div><p>Configure functions with DIGSI 5 for tailored solutions to detect any ground faults in compensated or isolated power systems. Monitor current and voltage signals up to the 50th harmonic accurately.</p></div></div><div data-area="card-info-section" class="d-flex flex-column justify-content-end h-100"></div></div></div></div><div class="siemens-cards col-md-4"><div data-ste-element="teaser" data-ste-teaser-type="card" data-ste-teaser-title="Communication protocols and cybersecurity" id="G_Communication%20protocols%20and%20cybersecurity-2" class="card blogWrapNoLink rounded-0" role="article" aria-labelledby="G_Communication%20protocols%20and%20cybersecurity-2-title" aria-describedby="G_Communication%20protocols%20and%20cybersecurity-2-desc" tabindex="0"><div class="imageWrapper"></div><div class="card-body d-flex flex-column p-3"><strong class="text-kicker pb-2 mb-0 text-color"></strong><div class="category d-none">all</div><h3 id="G_Communication%20protocols%20and%20cybersecurity-2-title" class="pb-4 mb-0">Communication protocols and cybersecurity</h3><div id="G_Communication%20protocols%20and%20cybersecurity-2-desc" class="text-black card-text pb-3 mb-0"><div><p>Use integrated Ethernet RJ45 for DIGSI 5 and IEC 61850 communication. Transmit data with PRP and HSR redundancy protocols. Role-based access control supports stronger cybersecurity.</p></div></div><div data-area="card-info-section" class="d-flex flex-column justify-content-end h-100"></div></div></div></div></div></div></section><template data-island><script type="module" 